    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "you said \"liberating\"... that's the only word that actually makes sense right now. the thought of just being nothing, of the weight finally being gone, it's the only thing that feels peaceful. everyone says i have to keep fighting, but why? if there's no anchor, why should i keep trying to stay in a place that doesn't want me? it feels like the most honest thing left to do is just surrender to the drift.",
